{"text": "Tor\nFron:\n\nsubject:\n\nPHILIP MORRIS INCORPORATED\nINTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE yr\nRICHMOND, VIRGINIA\n\nMr. J. S. Osmalov pate: April 18, 1967\nR. N, Thomson\n\nPlastic Diluted Parliament 100mm Test Market\n\nQur latest word is that there will be a potential test market\nfor the 100mm Parliament with the plastic diluted tip starting\non or about June 1. Approximate size is 1} million units per\nweek. Currently we have received two different specifications\nfor the cigarette, Mr. Budne indicated in his conversation\nwith Dr. Seligman that we want a lower delivery than the 20mg\ndry TPM. Subsequent to this Mr. Landry indicated that he\nwould like to see a 15mg wet TPM cigarette. It seems to me\nthat there is still some indecision involved in the exact\ncigarette,\n\nPlease arrange to test in our POL facilities the 20mg dry TPM\n100mm diluted Parliament vs the 15mg wet TPM cigarette. We\nwill interpret the 15mg wet TPM cigarette to have a range of\n14-L6mg.\n\nWe should still endeavor and increase our efforts to have all\nprocessing equipment ready for this test by May 15\n\nJeb Fr Ghomo\ncopies to R. B. Seligman\n\nL. L. Long\nG. L. Mathe\n\nc67-01995\n\npetessoo0o0t", "words": [{"text": "Tor", "x0": 35, "y0": 134, "x1": 51, "y1": 143, "conf": 83.0}, {"text": "Fron:", "x0": 35, "y0": 164, "x1": 62, "y1": 173, "conf": 62.0}, {"text": "subject:", "x0": 34, "y0": 193, "x1": 81, "y1": 204, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "PHILIP", "x0": 277, "y0": 30, "x1": 328, "y1": 42, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "MORRIS", "x0": 338, "y0": 31, "x1": 391, "y1": 43, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "INCORPORATED", "x0": 403, "y0": 32, "x1": 507, "y1": 44, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "INTER-OFFICE", "x0": 229, "y0": 55, "x1": 370, "y1": 67, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "CORRESPONDENCE", "x0": 389, "y0": 57, "x1": 557, "y1": 69, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "yr", "x0": 635, "y0": 46, "x1": 690, "y1": 76, "conf": 22.0}, {"text": "RICHMOND,", "x0": 325, "y0": 85, "x1": 387, "y1": 94, "conf": 76.0}, {"text": "VIR